.linkedin.com%2Fin%2Fsamiya-allen%2F%3ForiginalSubdomain%3Dbb&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C997e3622b47d41d260dd08de2c17da23%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C638996678112888868%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=hBADwwlC9TIR3NWt42HJD1%2BSUkKqE5tHN0XAqwkK19o%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">Samiya Allen</a>, Barbados, undergrad electronics, travel grant to UK for robotics training and career development.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fin%2Frosemutiso%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C997e3622b47d41d260dd08de2c17da23%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C638996678112903772%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=NCYtjieampKwbScVHUuyNRpVMOYW5KSPI8VQm0v%2Bzxg%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">Rose Mutiso</a>, Kenya, PhD UPenn in materials science, to create the African Tech Futures Lab, to improve policymaking on energy technologies.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fin%2Fdarren-ramsook%2F%3ForiginalSubdomain%3Die&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C997e3622b47d41d260dd08de2c17da23%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C638996678112917232%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=UjPo84wLfbNjWC%2Ftpn3O8hHUWKKS0Yd5ZKOp9OCWbhA%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">Darren Ramsook</a>, Trinidad &amp; Tobago, Postdoc at Trinity College Dublin, for research on AI-driven video compression.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fin%2Fcheyennepolius%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C997e3622b47d41d260dd08de2c17da23%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C638996678112931653%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=a9F7ECdCfCcwTRP7YmFpi%2Bbmt6u5ORD2Gd1%2BL5iTfoY%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">Cheyenne Polius</a>, St. Lucia, for work on astro-tourism and space education in the Caribbean.</p>\r\n<p>I thank <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fx.com%2Frasheedguo&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C997e3622b47d41d260dd08de2c17da23%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C638996678112947514%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=i3stZkoVGx2f5SlKj7rImOqNEdzFMc%2FsBqMYJ0h0Yl8%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">Rasheed Griffith</a> for his excellent work on this, and again Nabeel has created <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.evwinners.org%2F&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C997e3622b47d41d260dd08de2c17da23%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C638996678112962006%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=IuvvXnwZ4HTx%2Bbb1iIHq8OwlgUnFcDcb2UsKl55wcJU%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">excellent software</a> to help organize the list of winners, using AI.</p>\r\n<p>Those unfamiliar with Emergent Ventures can learn more <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmarginalrevolution.com%2Fmarginalrevolution%2F2018%2F09%2F